From: mtmorgan at fhcrc.org (Martin Morgan)
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2009 10:15:23 -0800
Subject: [BioC] error with ontoCompare (goTools)
In-Reply-To: <4970C30A.8090400@titus.u-strasbg.fr> (Wolfgang Raffelsberger's
	message of "Fri, 16 Jan 2009 18:25:30 +0100")
References: <4970AEE3.9030900@titus.u-strasbg.fr>
