Dear Boris,

see ?RG.MA from limma or the RG.MA code for computing normalized RG from
MA, i.e.

> RG.MA
function (object)
{
    object$R <- 2^(object$A + object$M/2)
    object$G <- 2^(object$A - object$M/2)
    object$M <- NULL
    object$A <- NULL
    new("RGList", unclass(object))
}
<environment: namespace:limma>

Cheers,

